RC or PLC in Iron County","/arc-plc/michigan/iron-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, and October to November in 27. In 2025 the middle saw February to March at 196% of normal and October to November at 70%. Grid 31365 had its driest year in 1976, at 60% of normal.</p>"}
